  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "こぶしで　だいちを　ひきさいたとふるい　たんけんきに　しるされたツバサノオウの　しょうたいらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "주먹으로 대지를 갈랐다고 오래된 탐험기에 기록된 “날개의왕”의 정체인 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠似乎就是古老的探險記裡提到的翼大王的真面目。據記載，牠曾以拳頭擊裂大地。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’agirait d’« Ailes-Royales », une créature qui, d’après un vieux récit d’exploration, aurait fendu la terre par la force de ses poings.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Offenbar ist dies die Kreatur Schwingenkönig, von der es in einem alten Expeditionsbericht hieß, sie habe die Erde mit bloßen Fäusten gespalten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece tratarse de Reyalado, la criatura que, según lo narrado en un antiguo diario, fue capaz de dividir la tierra con sus puños.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra si tratti del Realato che, stando a un antico diario di viaggio, scisse la terra con i suoi pugni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拳で　大地を　引き裂いたと古い　探検記に　記されたツバサノオウの　正体らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它似乎就是古老的探险记所提到的翼大王本尊。据记载，它曾用拳头击裂大地。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece tratarse de Reyalado, la criatura que, según lo narrado en un antiguo diario, fue capaz de dividir la tierra con sus puños.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "モトトカゲと　にた　いんしょうだがはるかに　たくましく　きょうぼう。せいたいなどは　いっさい　ふめい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "모토마를 닮았지만 그보다 훨씬 튼튼하고 흉포하다. 생태 등은 밝혀진 것이 전혀 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然長相相似，但頑強凶暴的程度卻是凌駕於摩托蜥之上。牠的生態等資訊目前一切不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à Motorizard, mais en bien plus robuste et violent. On ignore tout de son mode de vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt Mopex, ist aber deutlich kräftiger und brutaler. Über seine Lebensweise ist nichts bekannt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a sus similitudes con los Cyclizar, es mucho más violento y fornido. Se desconoce totalmente su relación con el entorno y otros seres vivos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Assomiglia a Cyclizar, ma è molto più vigoroso e notevolmente più feroce. Non si sa nulla del suo habitat o di altre sue caratteristiche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon resembles Cyclizar, but it is far burlier and more ferocious. Nothing is known about its ecology or other features.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "モトトカゲと　似た　印象だがはるかに　たくましく　凶暴。生態などは　一切　不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然外观与摩托蜥相似，但却远比后者更为顽强凶暴。有关它的生态等信息一切未明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a sus similitudes con los Cyclizar, es mucho más violento y fornido. Se desconoce totalmente su relación con el entorno y otros seres vivos.",
      "language": {
